      "snippet": "Squarespace API keys – Squarespace Help Center (https://support.squarespace.com/hc/en-us/articles/236297987-Squarespace-API-keys)\n【turn61search2】 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2 months ago; Crawled: today; An application programming interface (API) lets developers build integrations and applications that can connect to your Squarespace site. ... For help using the Squarespace Commerce APIs, visit our Developer Site, which has detailed documentation on all our public APIs.\n\nSquarespace API keys\n\nIn this guide\n\nNote: While our most popular guides have been translated into Spanish, some guides are only available in English.\n\n# Squarespace API keys\n\nLast updated August 27, 2026 15:48\n\n## Sections\n\n#### How to set up, use, and troubleshoot API keys to connect integrations to your site.\n\nAn application programming interface (API) lets developers build integrations and applications that can connect to your Squarespace site.\n\nThis guide provides a general overview of the Squarespace API and unique API keys. For detailed information, visit the API developer documentation.\n\nFor help with Zapier, visit Adding form integrations with Zapier.\n\n> The Squarespace API has the following availability. To learn more, visit Choosing the right Squarespace plan:\n> \n>   * Forms API (for Zapier integration) is available on Core, Plus, Advanced, Business, Commerce Basic, and Commerce Advanced plans.\n>   * Orders API is available in the Core, Plus, Advanced, and Commerce Advanced plan.\n\n## API key security\n\nYour unique API key is a randomized string of characters which permits authenticated access to your Squarespace account.\n\nTo create a new key:\n\n  1. Open the Developer tools panel.\n  2. Click Developer API Keys.\n  3. Click Generate Key.\n \n  4. Enter a Key Name.\n  5. Under Permissions, check Orders, Forms, Inventory, or Transactions. Forms are available in the Business plan or higher. Orders, Inventory, and Transactions are only available in the Commerce Advanced plan.\n  6. Select the permissio"
